The Priority "Boost" Logic
Your requirement about the Frequency Count is a great way to handle "crowdsourced" urgency.

Logic: When the AI marks an issue as a duplicate, your server increments the frequency of the Original document by 1.

The Trigger: If frequency >= 5, your code runs a "Level Up" function:

Low becomes Medium.

Medium becomes High.

High becomes Critical.

Reset: The frequency is reset to 0 to start the next count.




